Variant of test-disarm-restart-lrm1 with 'freeze' as disarm mode (services are
frozen on disarm) instead of 'ignore'.

The bug surfaces less visibly here because count_active_services skips frozen
services, so the LRM does not re-acquire the lock - it does however still mark
itself as 'restart' rather than preserving 'disarm'. With the fix both modes
follow the same clean exit path.
